# {{name}}

A TikTools plugin (`{{id}}`) created with `tiktools-plugin new --template {{template}}`.

## Develop

```bash
tiktools-plugin validate
tiktools-plugin build --release
tiktools-plugin dev stage --into <dev-plugins-dir>
```

Run TikTools with `TIKTOOLS_DEV_PLUGINS_DIR=<dev-plugins-dir>` to load the staged copy.

## Publish

```bash
tiktools-plugin keygen --id {{publisher}}-1 --publisher {{publisher}} --out ~/.tiktools/keys
tiktools-plugin build --release --sign ~/.tiktools/keys/{{publisher}}-1.key.json
tiktools-plugin validate --publish
tiktools-plugin publish dist-plugin/*.plugin --registry <registry-dir> --index-key <index.key.json>
```

Never commit `*.key.json` files.
